            "text": "<p>1. You must submit a claim to K-Swiss within 180 calendar days of date of purchase as evidenced by retail sale slip.</p><p>2. The outsole of your Ultrashot 3 or Ultrashot 4 shoe must have a hole in it through which the upper material of the shoe is visible.</p><p>3. This wear must have resulted exclusively from playing tennis, paddle tennis, or pickleball. Only one claim per purchase.</p>"
