          "settings": {
            "heading": "Which shoe does this guarantee apply to?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>This guarantee applies only to Ultrashot 3 or Ultrashot 4 shoes sold at retail stores within the 50 United States and the District of Columbia or purchased through www.kswiss.com by customers with delivery addresses within the 50 United States and the District of Columbia and who reside in those locations. Sample shoes do not qualify.<br/><br/></p>",
