        "collapsible_row_3ayyc3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are the upper and midsole covered by this guarantee?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The upper of the Ultrashot 3 and Ultrashot 4 are not covered by the guarantee. All uppers have DragGuard materials to protect them, but wear or holes in the upper due to extreme play are not covered by the outsole warranty. The warranty does not apply if the shoe has been abused or mishandled.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_YaUPdQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's next if my shoes qualify?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>After confirmation that the shoes qualify under the guarantee, K-Swiss Customer Relations will create and email you a promo code that you can use to place your replacement order on www.kswiss.com. This promo code is only valid for 6- months. After that timeframe, a replacement promo code will not be issued, regardless of circumstances. Your code will only be valid to replace the same product that you returned. So, if you returned and Ultrashot 3 you need to pick from the remaining Ultrashot 3’s that are available. Ultrashot 4’s will be given a code for new Ultrashot 4’s.</p><p>A $10.00 fee plus state applicable tax will be applied to cover shipping and handling costs at the time the replacement order is entered.</p>",
